msgstr "  %-20s lyder som %-20s %s %% af den i det spor, %s point foran den næste"

msgid "  It holds under one assumption: one microphone per person, and each of them carrying only that person. Where the tracks overlap too much to be told apart, or two voices point at the same microphone, nothing is said at all rather than something uncertain."
msgstr "  Det gælder under én antagelse: én mikrofon pr. person, og hver af dem bærer kun den person. Hvor sporene overlapper for meget til at kunne skelnes, eller to stemmer peger på den samme mikrofon, siges der hellere slet intet end noget usikkert."

